      "index": "cyd9",
      "created": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d5_nbk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11440,
      "width": 1880,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 140048,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 807698720,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790169539087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One deposit can cover dozens of claims, so the only correct path runs through the remittance — never by scanning claims for one whose amount matches.\nWhen the ACH addenda are stripped, which happens to about one deposit in five, trn02 is simply blank and the fallback is exact amount within three banking days.\nThat match is recorded under a weaker basis, so \"we know this matched\" stays distinguishable from \"we inferred it\". Rebate deposits ride the same column,\ncarrying the manufacturer's allocation_code where a claim payment would carry trn02.",
      "originalText": "One deposit can cover dozens of claims, so the only correct path runs through the remittance — never by scanning claims for one whose amount matches.\nWhen the ACH addenda are stripped, which happens to about one deposit in five, trn02 is simply blank and the fallback is exact amount within three banking days.\nThat match is recorded under a weaker basis, so \"we know this matched\" stays distinguishable from \"we inferred it\". Rebate deposits ride the same column,\ncarrying the manufacturer's allocation_code where a claim payment would carry trn02.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "index": "cydA",
      "created": null
