      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790169539088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If a record's keys resolve to nothing, it is PARKED — never dropped.\nEvery later arrival also looks backwards at the parked pool, so a deposit that\nbeat its own remittance to the door still finds it three weeks later.",
